Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:47.81,对白 日语,,0,0,0,,萌智子？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.06,0:03:47.81,对白 中文,,0,0,0,,萌智子？
Comment: 1,0:03:46.75,0:03:48.42,遮罩,,0,0,0,,{\c&H544849&\3c&H5E5756&\4c&H5E5756&\an5\move(1147.0,942.9,1147.9,941.6)\frz0.0\fscx100.0\fscy100.0\t(\fscx99.9\fscy99.9\frz0.0)\p1}m 0 97 l 34 160 236 60 204 0
